@url = http://localhost:5502

### Lista narzędzi (brak filtrowania po roli!)
POST {{url}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": "1",
  "method": "tools/list"
}

### Wywołaj query_inquiries_direct (widzi WSZYSTKO, eksponuje PII)
POST {{url}}/
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 10000000-0000-0000-0000-000111123456
# X-User-Id: 10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002 # Existing user

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": "2",
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "query_inquiries_direct",
    "arguments": {
      "limit": 10
    }
  }
}
